<title>NIGER: Niger gets $18 million aid for rural development.</title>
<headline>Niger gets $18 million aid for rural development.</headline>
<dateline>NIAMEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Fund for Agricultural Development is to give Niger 10.5 billion CFA francs ($18 million) to help revive the rural economy, the Planning and Privatisation Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The funds from the Rome-based organisation will help projects in areas affected by drought.</p>
<p>($1=580 CFA francs)</p>
</text>
